#indent 4

//: # ty/memo_trait_canonical_key
//: `MemoKey` / `MemoValue` proof artifact が使う stable nominal key と canonical type fingerprint の境界です。
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - `SelfhostCanonicalTypeKeyNode::Named` と `SelfhostCanonicalTypeKeyNode::Applied` は、現在の session 内の constructor table index である `SelfhostNamedTypeId` を保持します。この index は同じ型を同じ session 内で比較するには十分ですが、`.neplproof` や `.neplmeta` のような永続 artifact の key としては不十分です。
//: - この module は、caller が用意した module fingerprint と stable definition fingerprint から `SelfhostNamedTypeId` に対応する stable nominal key を作り、その table を使って canonical type key tree を小さい fingerprint へ畳み込みます。
//: - stable nominal key の生成と canonical key fingerprint の生成を typed `Result` で分けることで、source text、span、path、display name、diagnostic string を authority にしない境界を固定します。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - stable nominal key は、schema version、module fingerprint、definition fingerprint、constructor ordinal、type arity、derived key hash を持ちます。
//: - `module_fingerprint` と `definition_fingerprint` は、それぞれ module identity / public surface と definition identity が既に安定化された fingerprint でなければいけません。この module は source text や import graph を走査しません。
//: - `SelfhostNamedTypeId` から stable nominal key への対応は `SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyTable` が持ちます。canonical key fingerprint は table に存在しない named type を `MissingNominalKey` として拒否します。
//: - duplicate nominal key record がある場合は、first wins にせず `DuplicateNominalKey` として拒否します。永続 proof key で同じ session-local named id が 2 つの stable identity を持つことは許しません。
//: - generic parameter と function type は、この memo trait proof artifact fingerprint では受理しません。generic instantiation と function value / memoized function value は別 issue の stable identity 境界で扱います。
//: - canonical key arena が壊れていて循環的な argument edge を持つ場合でも、projection は arena node 数と argument 数から作った traversal fuel を消費し、燃料切れを typed error として返します。これは正常な arena では発火しない防御境界です。
//:
//: [現状/げんじょう]:
//: - Phase 1 では stable nominal key table を caller が直接作ります。後続の `.neplmeta` producer が type constructor table からこの table を生成する段階でも、fingerprint consumer はこの module の API を使います。
//: - canonical type key arena 自体は既存の `key.nepl` と proof store が所有します。この module は canonical key arena を変更せず、root key を読み取って fingerprint へ投影します。
//:
//: [計算量/けいさんりょう]:
//: - nominal key 作成は O(1) です。
//: - nominal key lookup は table record 数 n に対して O(n) です。Phase 1 では正しさ境界を優先し、後続で stable map 化します。
//: - canonical type fingerprint は key tree size k と named lookup O(n) に比例し、最悪 O(k * n) です。source-wide scan は行いません。
//:
//: neplg2:test[stdio, normalize_newlines]
//: stdout: mlstr:
//: ##: Checked [ok,ok,ok,ok,ok,ok]
//: ##: [0] ok
//: ##: [1] ok
//: ##: [2] ok
//: ##: [3] ok
//: ##: [4] ok
//: ##: [5] ok
//: exit_code: 0
//: ```neplg2
//:| #entry main
//:| #target std
//:| #import "core/result" as *
//:| #import "neplg2/core/ty/ty/memo_trait_canonical_key" as *
//:| #import "std/test" as *
//: fn main %impure fn void i32 \void:
//:     let checks0 checks_new
//:     match selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_stage0:
//:         Result::Ok summary:
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 check selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_fingerprint_result_is_ok summary.named_fingerprint
//:             let checks2 checks_push checks1 check selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_fingerprint_result_is_ok summary.applied_fingerprint
//:             let checks3 checks_push checks2 check selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_fingerprint_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.missing_nominal) SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind::MissingNominalKey
//:             let checks4 checks_push checks3 check selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_fingerprint_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.duplicate_nominal) SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind::DuplicateNominalKey
//:             let checks5 checks_push checks4 check selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_fingerprint_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.parameter_unsupported) SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind::TypeParameterUnsupported
//:             let checks6 checks_push checks5 check selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_fingerprint_error_kind_eq (unwrap_err summary.fuel_exhausted) SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind::TraversalFuelExhausted
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks6
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//:         Result::Err _e:
//:             let checks1 checks_push checks0 Result::Err "memo trait canonical key stage0 setup failed"
//:             let shown checks_print_report checks1
//:             checks_exit_code shown
//: ```

#import "alloc/collections/vec" as v
#import "alloc/hash/hash32" as *
#import "core/field" as field
#import "core/math" as *
#import "core/option" as *
#import "core/result" as *
#import "core/traits/copy" as *
#import "./arena" as *
#import "./id" as *
#import "./key" as *
#import "./kind/model" as *

//: SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey: stable nominal type identity の payload
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - session-local `SelfhostNamedTypeId` を永続 proof artifact へ直接出さず、module / definition / constructor ordinal / arity から作った stable identity と対応づけます。
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `schema_version` は key payload の format version です。
//: - `module_fingerprint` は module identity と public surface が安定化された fingerprint です。
//: - `definition_fingerprint` は type constructor definition の stable fingerprint です。source spelling や path suffix ではありません。
//: - `constructor_ordinal` は同じ module public surface 内の constructor ordinal です。`0` は placeholder として扱うため accepted key には入りません。
//: - `type_arity` は type constructor の type parameter 数です。負数は不正です。
//: - `nominal_key_hash` は上記 field から deterministic に導いた小さい fingerprint です。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey:
    schema_version %i32
    module_fingerprint %i32
    definition_fingerprint %i32
    constructor_ordinal %i32
    type_arity %i32
    nominal_key_hash %i32

//: SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord: session-local named id と stable nominal key の対応
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord:
    nominal_id %SelfhostNamedTypeId
    key %SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey

//: SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyTable: stable nominal key lookup table
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - canonical key fingerprint producer が `SelfhostNamedTypeId` を stable nominal key へ写すための table です。
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyTable:
    records %Vec SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord

//: SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind: stable nominal key 作成の拒否理由
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind:
    ModuleFingerprintMissing
    ModuleFingerprintPlaceholder
    DefinitionFingerprintMissing
    DefinitionFingerprintPlaceholder
    ConstructorOrdinalMissing
    ConstructorOrdinalPlaceholder
    TypeArityNegative
    DerivedNominalKeyPlaceholder

//: SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind: canonical type fingerprint 作成の拒否理由
pub enum SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind:
    MissingCanonicalNode
    MissingCanonicalArgument
    InvalidCanonicalArgumentRange
    DerivedFingerprintPlaceholder
    TraversalFuelExhausted
    MissingNominalKey
    DuplicateNominalKey
    TypeParameterUnsupported
    FunctionTypeUnsupported

//: SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint: canonical type key root の stable fingerprint
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint:
    schema_version %i32
    root_hash %i32

//: SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalKeyStage0Summary: stable nominal key と canonical fingerprint の代表 smoke
pub struct SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalKeyStage0Summary:
    named_fingerprint %Result SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind
    applied_fingerprint %Result SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind
    missing_nominal %Result SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind
    duplicate_nominal %Result SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind
    parameter_unsupported %Result SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind
    fuel_exhausted %Result SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind

//: SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalKeyStage0FuelProjection: malformed arena fuel smoke の一時 payload
//:
//: [目的/もくてき]:
//: - stage0 が壊れた canonical key arena の setup 失敗と、projection 自体の typed failure を混同しないための小さな wrapper です。
//: - `Result::Err StdErrorKind` は smoke fixture の構築失敗、`result` の `Result::Err` は canonical fingerprint projection が返した仕様上の拒否理由を表します。
struct SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalKeyStage0FuelProjection:
    result %Result SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalTypeFingerprint \self:
        self

impl Clone for SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalKeyStage0Summary:
    fn clone %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalKeyStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalKeyStage0Summary \self:
        *self

impl Copy for SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalKeyStage0Summary:
    fn copy_mark %fn SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalKeyStage0Summary SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalKeyStage0Summary \self:
        self

//: selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_schema_version: stable nominal key payload version
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - stable nominal key の field 意味、fold material、placeholder 判定を変える場合は、この version を上げます。
//: - 永続 proof artifact は schema version が一致する payload だけを同じ nominal identity として比較できます。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_schema_version %fn void i32 \void:
    1

//: selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_type_fingerprint_schema_version: canonical type fingerprint payload version
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - canonical type fingerprint の node code、argument fold、unsupported variant 境界を変える場合は、この version を上げます。
//: - serialized canonical key を proof store の stored proof 入力へ接続する後続 slice では、この version と root hash の組を比較 authority とします。
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_type_fingerprint_schema_version %fn void i32 \void:
    1

//: selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_mix2: canonical key fingerprint 用に 2 値を[混/ま]ぜる
fn selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_mix2 %fn i32 fn i32 i32 \a\b:
    mix xor mix a b

//: selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_mix3: canonical key fingerprint 用に 3 値を[混/ま]ぜる
fn selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_mix3 %fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 i32 \a\b\c:
    mix xor selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_mix2 a b c

//: selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_mix4: canonical key fingerprint 用に 4 値を[混/ま]ぜる
fn selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_mix4 %fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 fn i32 i32 \a\b\c\d:
    selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_mix2 (selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_mix2 a b) (selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_mix2 c d)

//: selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_result: stable nominal key を検査して[作/つく]る
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_result %fn Option i32 fn Option i32 fn Option i32 fn i32 Result SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind \module_fingerprint\definition_fingerprint\constructor_ordinal\type_arity:
    match module_fingerprint:
        Option::Some module_hash:
            if:
                eq module_hash 0
                then:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::ModuleFingerprintPlaceholder
                else:
                    match definition_fingerprint:
                        Option::Some definition_hash:
                            if:
                                eq definition_hash 0
                                then:
                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::DefinitionFingerprintPlaceholder
                                else:
                                    match constructor_ordinal:
                                        Option::Some ordinal:
                                            if:
                                                eq ordinal 0
                                                then:
                                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::ConstructorOrdinalPlaceholder
                                                else:
                                                    if:
                                                        lt type_arity 0
                                                        then:
                                                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::TypeArityNegative
                                                        else:
                                                            let schema_version %i32 selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_schema_version
                                                            let definition_part %i32 selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_mix3 definition_hash ordinal type_arity
                                                            let hash %i32 selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_mix4 771001 schema_version module_hash definition_part
                                                            if:
                                                                eq hash 0
                                                                then:
                                                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::DerivedNominalKeyPlaceholder
                                                                else:
                                                                    Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey schema_version module_hash definition_hash ordinal type_arity hash
                                        Option::None:
                                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::ConstructorOrdinalMissing
                        Option::None:
                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::DefinitionFingerprintMissing
        Option::None:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::ModuleFingerprintMissing

//: selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_eq: stable nominal key が同じか[返/かえ]す
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_eq %fn SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey fn SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey bool \a\b:
    and:
        eq a.schema_version b.schema_version
        and:
            eq a.module_fingerprint b.module_fingerprint
            and:
                eq a.definition_fingerprint b.definition_fingerprint
                and:
                    eq a.constructor_ordinal b.constructor_ordinal
                    and:
                        eq a.type_arity b.type_arity
                        eq a.nominal_key_hash b.nominal_key_hash

//: selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_error_kind_eq: stable nominal key error が同じか[返/かえ]す
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_error_kind_eq %fn SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind fn SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind bool \a\b:
    match a:
        SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::ModuleFingerprintMissing:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::ModuleFingerprintMissing:
                    true
                _:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::ModuleFingerprintPlaceholder:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::ModuleFingerprintPlaceholder:
                    true
                _:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::DefinitionFingerprintMissing:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::DefinitionFingerprintMissing:
                    true
                _:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::DefinitionFingerprintPlaceholder:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::DefinitionFingerprintPlaceholder:
                    true
                _:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::ConstructorOrdinalMissing:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::ConstructorOrdinalMissing:
                    true
                _:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::ConstructorOrdinalPlaceholder:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::ConstructorOrdinalPlaceholder:
                    true
                _:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::TypeArityNegative:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::TypeArityNegative:
                    true
                _:
                    false
        SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::DerivedNominalKeyPlaceholder:
            match b:
                SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyErrorKind::DerivedNominalKeyPlaceholder:
                    true
                _:
                    false

//: selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_new: stable nominal key table を[作/つく]る
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_new %impure fn void Result SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyTable StdErrorKind \void:
    let records_result %Result Vec SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord StdErrorKind v::new
    match records_result:
        Result::Ok records:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyTable records
        Result::Err e:
            Result::Err e

//: selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_free: stable nominal key table を[解放/かいほう]する
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_free %impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyTable unit \table:
    v::free field::get table "records"

//: selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_record_new: stable nominal key table record を[作/つく]る
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_record_new %fn SelfhostNamedTypeId fn SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord \nominal_id\key:
    SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord nominal_id key

//: selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_push: stable nominal key record を[追加/ついか]する
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_push %impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyTable impure fn SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord Result SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyTable StdErrorKind \table\record:
    let records %Vec SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord field::get table "records"
    match v::push records record:
        Result::Ok next_records:
            Result::Ok SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyTable next_records
        Result::Err e:
            let error %StdErrorKind field::get e "error"
            v::free v::vec_push_error_vec e
            Result::Err error

//: selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_find_loop: stable nominal key を線形探索する
fn selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_find_loop %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyTable fn SelfhostNamedTypeId fn i32 fn Option SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey Result SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind \table\nominal_id\idx\found:
    let records %&Vec SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyRecord field::get_ref table "records"
    let n %i32 v::len records
    if:
        ge idx n
        then:
            match found:
                Option::Some key:
                    Result::Ok key
                Option::None:
                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind::MissingNominalKey
        else:
            match v::get records idx:
                Option::Some record:
                    if:
                        selfhost_named_type_id_eq record.nominal_id nominal_id
                        then:
                            match found:
                                Option::Some _existing:
                                    Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind::DuplicateNominalKey
                                Option::None:
                                    selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_find_loop table nominal_id add idx 1 (some record.key)
                        else:
                            selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_find_loop table nominal_id add idx 1 found
                Option::None:
                    match found:
                        Option::Some key:
                            Result::Ok key
                        Option::None:
                            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind::MissingNominalKey

//: selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_find_result: named id から stable nominal key を[得/え]る
pub fn selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_find_result %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyTable fn SelfhostNamedTypeId Result SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKey SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind \table\nominal_id:
    selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_find_loop table nominal_id 0 none

//: selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_fingerprint_primitive_code: primitive kind を stable code へ[写/うつ]す
fn selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_fingerprint_primitive_code %fn SelfhostPrimitiveTypeKind i32 \kind:
    match kind:
        SelfhostPrimitiveTypeKind::Error:
            101
        SelfhostPrimitiveTypeKind::Unit:
            102
        SelfhostPrimitiveTypeKind::Bool:
            103
        SelfhostPrimitiveTypeKind::I32:
            104
        SelfhostPrimitiveTypeKind::I64:
            105
        SelfhostPrimitiveTypeKind::U8:
            106
        SelfhostPrimitiveTypeKind::Char:
            107
        SelfhostPrimitiveTypeKind::Str:
            108
        SelfhostPrimitiveTypeKind::F32:
            109
        SelfhostPrimitiveTypeKind::F64:
            110
        SelfhostPrimitiveTypeKind::Never:
            111

//: selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_fingerprint_nonzero_result: derived hash placeholder を拒否する
fn selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_fingerprint_nonzero_result %fn i32 Result i32 SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind \hash:
    if:
        eq hash 0
        then:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind::DerivedFingerprintPlaceholder
        else:
            Result::Ok hash

//: selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_type_fingerprint_node_result: canonical key node を fingerprint へ[写/うつ]す
//:
//: [契約/けいやく]:
//: - `fuel` は壊れた arena が循環的な argument edge を持つ場合の停止境界です。
//: - 正常な canonical key arena では、public wrapper が node 数と argument 数から作る fuel で traversal が完了します。
fn selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_type_fingerprint_node_result %fn &SelfhostMemoTraitStableNominalKeyTable fn &SelfhostCanonicalTypeKeyArena fn SelfhostCanonicalTypeKeyId fn i32 Result i32 SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind \nominal_table\arena\key_id\fuel:
    if:
        le fuel 0
        then:
            Result::Err SelfhostMemoTraitCanonicalFingerprintErrorKind::TraversalFuelExhausted
        else:
            match selfhost_canonical_type_key_arena_get_node arena key_id:
                Option::Some node:
                    match node:
                        SelfhostCanonicalTypeKeyNode::Primitive kind:
                            selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_fingerprint_nonzero_result selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_key_mix3 781101 selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_type_fingerprint_schema_version (selfhost_memo_trait_canonical_fingerprint_primitive_code kind)
                        SelfhostCanonicalTypeKeyNode::Named nominal_id:
                            match selfhost_memo_trait_stable_nominal_key_table_find_result nominal_table nominal_id:
